# Product prices/dates are managed per-product in the admin dashboard
# (Products tab) and hero carousel slides in the Hero Carousel tab, both
# stored in Firestore using the NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* vars above.

# Cloudinary is used for image uploads from the admin dashboard (product
# photos + hero carousel slides) instead of Firebase Storage, since it has
# a free tier (25GB) that doesn't require a billing/card upgrade.
# Server-only - do not prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_. Get these from your
# Cloudinary Dashboard (cloudinary.com) after creating a free account.
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME
your_cloud_name

CLOUDINARY_API_KEY
your_api_key

CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET
your_api_secret

